armada settings — every setting: its value, where it lives, whether it syncs

USAGE
  armada settings [--json]

FLAGS
  --json          answer as one JSON object, for a script or an agent
  --color <when>  auto (default), always, never; NO_COLOR wins

Read-only. `armada helm enable`/`disable` and the guild's own verbs are
still how a setting changes; this only shows what they left behind.
A setting nobody has touched still gets a row, with its default.
